menu "WiFi Provisioning Configuration"
    config USE_REAL_WIFI_PROV
        bool "Use real WiFi/NVS/mDNS provisioning callbacks"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, uses real ESP-IDF WiFi, NVS, and mDNS APIs
            for provisioning. When disabled, mock callbacks that only
            log to stdout are used (suitable for QEMU testing).
endmenu
